  "hypothesis": "H-C13-3: affine spectra are exactly the sets {N : a fixed polynomial system has a root mod N}; they are divisor-closed and closed under coprime products, every finite one is the set of divisors of a single integer, and the infinite ones are governed by the Q-gcd of the system (a classical quadratic/cubic residue condition plus finitely many exceptional primes).",
